1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,380
Good afternoon, shoppers.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:07,300
The management here at the Maytag Department Store would like to wish everyone a very happy Christmas.

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,440
For your convenience, this store has extended its opening hours.

4
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:16,550
We will be closing at 10:00 p. m. this evening instead of 9 like we always do.

5
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:22,840
This will allow all those last-minute shoppers to buy their family the presents which they so richly deserve.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:32,240
In fact, why don't you make an evening of it and invite your loved ones to dinner at the basement gourmet cafeteria, which will be open until 8?

7
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,930
Thank you, and merry Christmas.
